'''Season twenty-seven''' of ''[[Dancing with the Stars (American TV series)|Dancing with the Stars]]'' premiered on September 24, 2018, on the [[American Broadcasting Company|ABC]] network.<ref>{{cite news|url=https://variety.com/2018/tv/news/roseanne-the-connors-1202882075/|title=ABC Fall Premiere Dates: 'Roseanne' Spinoff 'The Conners' Sets Debut|last=Holloway|first=Daniel|date=July 24, 2018|access-date=August 28, 2018|website=[[Variety (magazine)|Variety]]|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180724172509/https://variety.com/2018/tv/news/roseanne-the-connors-1202882075/|archive-date=July 24, 2018|url-status=live}}</ref>

On November 19, radio personality [[Bobby Bones]] and [[Sharna Burgess]] were crowned the champions, while [[Disney Channel]] star [[Milo Manheim]] and [[Witney Carson]] finished in second place, actress [[Evanna Lynch]] and [[Keo Motsepe]] finished in third place, and model [[Alexis Ren]] and [[Alan Bersten (dancer)|Alan Bersten]] finished in fourth.<ref name="Final" />

==Cast==

===Couples===
This season featured thirteen celebrity contestants. The thirteen professional dancers were revealed on ''[[Good Morning America]]'' on August 28, 2018.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://abcnews.go.com/GMA/Culture/dancing-stars-season-27-newly-engaged-couple-val/story?id=57445000|title=Dancing With the Stars season 27: Newly engaged couple Val Chmerkovskiy and Jenna Johnson to compete as pros|work=[[ABC News (United States)|ABC News]]|date=August 28, 2018|access-date=August 28, 2018|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180828154734/https://abcnews.go.com/GMA/Culture/dancing-stars-season-27-newly-engaged-couple-val/story?id=57445000|archive-date=August 28, 2018|url-status=live}}</ref> The ten professionals from [[Dancing with the Stars (American season 26)|last season]] returned, along with [[Cheryl Burke]] and [[Valentin Chmerkovskiy]], both of whom had last competed in [[Dancing with the Stars (American season 25)|season 25]]. Troupe dancer [[Brandon Armstrong (dancer)|Brandon Armstrong]] made his debut in the pro lineup.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://abcnews.go.com/GMA/Culture/dancing-stars-pro-shares-dance-history/story?id=57732851|title=Meet the new 'Dancing With the Stars' pro dancer Brandon Armstrong|work=[[ABC News (United States)|ABC News]]|date=September 11, 2018|access-date=September 12, 2018|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180912015309/https://abcnews.go.com/GMA/Culture/dancing-stars-pro-shares-dance-history/story?id=57732851|archive-date=September 12, 2018|url-status=live}}</ref> [[Nancy McKeon]] was announced as the first celebrity competing for the season, partnered with Chmerkovskiy.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://abcnews.go.com/GMA/Culture/val-chmerkovskiy-dance-nancy-mckeon-season-27-dancing/story?id=57607663|title=Val Chmerkovskiy will dance with Nancy McKeon on season 27 of Dancing With the Stars|publisher=[[ABC News (United States)|ABC News]]|work=[[Good Morning America]]|first=Kelly|last=McCarthy|date=September 5, 2018|access-date=September 10, 2018|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180910014958/https://abcnews.go.com/GMA/Culture/val-chmerkovskiy-dance-nancy-mckeon-season-27-dancing/story?id=57607663|archive-date=September 10, 2018|url-status=live}}</ref> On September 12, the rest of the cast was revealed on ''Good Morning America''.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.etonline.com/dancing-with-the-stars-season-27-cast-revealed-meet-the-celebs-and-their-pro-partners-109440|title='Dancing With the Stars' Season 27 Cast Revealed -- Meet the Celebs and Their Pro Partners!|work=[[Entertainment Tonight]]|first=Desiree|last=Murphy|date=September 12, 2018|access-date=September 12, 2018|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180912152600/https://www.etonline.com/dancing-with-the-stars-season-27-cast-revealed-meet-the-celebs-and-their-pro-partners-109440|archive-date=September 12, 2018|url-status=live}}</ref> The dance troupe for season 27 consisted of season 26 troupe members Artur Adamski, [[Hayley Erbert]], [[Britt Stewart]], and Morgan Larson; along with newcomer Vladislav Kvartin.<ref>{{cite web |date=September 20, 2018 |title=Our Season 27 Troupe has a new member! Everyone help us welcome @vladkvartin |url=https://www.instagram.com/p/Bn9X_BFhAf-/ |url-access=limited |archive-url=https://ghostarchive.org/iarchive/s/instagram/Bn9X_BFhAf- |archive-date=2021-12-24 |access-date=September 25, 2018 |via=[[Instagram]]}}{{cbignore}}</ref>

